.TH SHIELD 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded 158367ea" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
shield \- Run Shield, the Kingdom's WAF / Zero\-Trust gateway daemon.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B shield
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run Shield, the Kingdom's WAF / Zero\-Trust gateway daemon.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-listen \fISTRING\fR
HTTP listen address, overriding \-\-port; off loopback needs AUTH_ENABLED=true
.TP
.B \-\-port \fIN\fR
HTTP port to bind on loopback (default 19009)
.TP
.B \-\-shutdown\-timeout \fIDURATION\fR
graceful shutdown deadline (default 10s)
.TP
.B \-\-wotan\-grpc \fISTRING\fR
Wotan gRPC address (default 127.0.0.1:18001)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
shield
shield \-\-port 19007
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
